  Default locale: Russian.

  The first deployment is for a Russian-speaking user, so Russian is the source of
  truth rather than a translation of English. An English locale will be added under
  values-en/ without moving anything.

  House style, from docs/design/design-language.md §8:
    * «вы», never «ты»
    * no emoji, anywhere
    * exclamation marks only in genuine safety copy
    * «занятие», not «сессия»
    * never a claim about what the app will do for this person
-->
